Package: draftstats
Type: Package
Title: Analyzing NBA and WNBA Career Performance Relative to Draft Position
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Brianna", "Rubinstein",
      email = "briannarubinstein2027@u.northwestern.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides tools to use data from NBA and WNBA players from their rookie season
  throughout their careers to see if their draft position is reflected
  in performance. Includes three datasets, NBA draft data and player statistics across 
  multiple seasons, NBA draft data and career per-game statistics, and WNBA draft data with 
  career per-game statistics. Includes functions to summarize a statistic across a range of draft 
  picks, compare statistics between two ranges of draft picks, compare a player's statistics to
  players drafted near them, and compare a player to themselves across different seasons.
